tilOOB- Scoped#Related":[415,420],"#TopicUtilOOB- Scoped#Related#{1}":[417,417],"#TopicUtilOOB- Scoped#Related#{2}":[418,418],"#TopicUtilOOB- Scoped#Related#{3}":[419,420]},"outlinks":[{"title":"script includes","target":"c_ScriptIncludes","line":28},{"title":"External event management via Telecommunications API notifications","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/telecom-service-ops/telecommunications-api-notification.md","line":30},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":32},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":36},{"title":"validateAndInsertTopic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicUtilOOBAPIScoped.md","line":38},{"title":"triggerSubflow\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicUtilOOBAPIScoped.md","line":132},{"title":"validateAndInsertTopics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicUtilOOBAPIScoped.md","line":175},{"title":"sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt\\_topic\\} table containing this data.\n\nThe passed topics payload is obtained from the \"GET API endpoint\" used to retrieve topics from an external system. For more information on triggering this GET API, see [triggerSubflow\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicUtilOOBAPIScoped.md","line":213},{"title":"TMF688 Event Management API User Guide","target":"https://www.tmforum.org/resources/standard/tmf688-event-management-api-user-guide-v4-0-0/","line":328},{"title":"TMF688 Event Management API User Guide","target":"https://www.tmforum.org/resources/standard/tmf688-event-management-api-user-guide-v4-0-0/","line":342},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":366},{"title":"Script includes","target":"c_ScriptIncludes","line":417},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":418},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":419}],"metadata":{"title":"TopicUtilOOB - Scoped","description":"The TopicUtilOOB script include contains functions that enable you to query and manipulate records in the Topic \\[sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt\\_topic\\] table. This class operates at the service layer that interacts with the Data Access Object \\(DAO\\) class.Creates a record in the Topic \\[sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt\\_topic\\] table using DAO insert.Returns the name of the subflow to call to obtain topics from an external system.Triggers the subflow that is responsible for obtaining topic records from an external system.Validates the passed in topic record payload and inserts records in the Topic \\[sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt\\_topic\\} table containing this data.Determines whether any other topic record in the Topic \\[sn\\_api\\_notif\\_mgmt\\_topic\\] table contains the specified combination of fields as its composite key, indicating a duplicate topic.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicUtilOOBAPIScoped.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":7,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[72,81],[107,111],[126,148],[163,187],[209,260],[269,286],[393,413]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/TopicUtilOOBAPIScoped.md"},
